<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">chemistry</ansi>

Companions who have fought and travelled together for a long time learn
each other's ways. Each member of your company builds up service for every
round they spend alive beside at least one other member, while you're
logged in.

The company's chemistry comes from the average service of the members
together, so a new recruit dilutes it until they have served their time:

  <ansi fg="command">Familiar</ansi>  about 1 game day together   +2% to hit
  <ansi fg="command">Trusted</ansi>   about 3 game days together  +4% to hit
  <ansi fg="command">Sworn</ansi>     about 7 game days together  +6% to hit

Every member together in the room gets the bonus, you and your
companions alike, new recruits included. When a blow lands only because of it, you'll see:
<ansi fg="command">Fighting beside a companion you know well, you find an opening.</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">company chemistry</ansi>
  Show your company's chemistry, its progress to the next tier, and each
  member's service.

  <ansi fg="command">status bonuses</ansi>
  Your bonuses, chemistry among them.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help combat</ansi>.
